{"title":"protobuf","uid":"8787a778f597e224d56cf17fd4bd2c5c","slug":"protobuf/protobuf","date":"2025-02-19T22:51:22.000Z","updated":"2025-04-05T00:48:10.789Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/protobuf/protobuf.json","keywords":null,"cover":null,"content":"<h4 id=\"1-执行命令编译\"><a href=\"#1-执行命令编译\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 执行命令编译\"></a>1. 执行命令编译</h4><figure class=\"shiki shell\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #FFCB6B\">protoc</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C3E88D\">--java_out=./src/main/java</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C3E88D\">./proto3/User.proto</span></span></code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<h4 id=\"2-通过maven插件\"><a href=\"#2-通过maven插件\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 通过maven插件\"></a>2. 通过maven插件</h4><figure class=\"shiki xml\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">build</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">  </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">extensions</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">&lt;!--判断系统--&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">extension</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">      </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">groupId</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">kr.motd.maven</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">groupId</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">      </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">artifactId</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">os-maven-plugin</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">artifactId</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">      </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">version</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">1.7.1</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">version</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">extension</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">  </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">extensions</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">  </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">plugins</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">&lt;!--</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">        Protobuf Maven 插件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">        作用：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">             - 自动下载和使用 protoc 编译器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">             - 编译 .proto 文件生成 Java 代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">             - 集成到 Maven 生命周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">     --&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">plugin</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">      </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">groupId</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">org.xolstice.maven.plugins</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">groupId</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">      </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">artifactId</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">protobuf-maven-plugin</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">artifactId</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">      </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">version</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">0.6.1</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">version</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">      </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">extensions</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">true</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">extensions</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">      </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">configuration</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">        </span><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">&lt;!-- protoc 编译器配置 --&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">        </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">protocArtifact</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">com.google.protobuf:protoc:${protobuf.version}:exe:${os.detected.classifier}</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">protocArtifact</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">        </span><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">&lt;!-- proto 文件源目录 --&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">        </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">protoSourceRoot</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">${project.basedir}/src/main/proto</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">protoSourceRoot</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">        </span><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">&lt;!-- 生成的 Java 代码输出目录 --&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">        </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">outputDirectory</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">${project.build.directory}/generated-sources/protobuf/java</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">outputDirectory</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">        </span><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">&lt;!-- 是否清空输出目录 --&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">        </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">clearOutputDirectory</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">true</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">clearOutputDirectory</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">      </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">configuration</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">      </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">executions</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">        </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">execution</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">          </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">phase</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">generate-sources</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">phase</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">          </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">goals</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">            </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">goal</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">compile</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">goal</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">          </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">goals</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">        </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">execution</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">      </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">executions</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">plugin</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">  </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">plugins</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">build</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<h4 id=\"3-proto3\"><a href=\"#3-proto3\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. proto3\"></a>3. proto3</h4><ul>\n<li>所有字段都有默认值，比如string默认为空串</li>\n<li>因为有默认值，所以所有的字段都是不为null的，需要判断是否为空，hasXXX()、getCount() &gt; 0 等等进行判断</li>\n<li>使用 1-15 的字段号给最常用的字段  （频繁访问的字段放在前面，cpu缓存命中率更高）</li>\n<li>不常用字段使用 16+ 的字段号  （不常访问的字段放在后面）</li>\n<li>对于较小范围的数字，用 int32 而不是 int64</li>\n<li>固定长度的数字用 fixed32&#x2F;fixed64</li>\n<li>对于负数多的场景用 sint32&#x2F;sint64</li>\n<li>字段更新规则！！<ol>\n<li>添加新字段</li>\n<li>删除字段(但保留字段号)</li>\n<li>重命名字段(字段号不变)</li>\n<li>添加repeated字段   reserved 2, 15, 9 to 11;       &#x2F;&#x2F; 保留字段号  reserved “foo”, “bar”;         &#x2F;&#x2F; 保留字段名</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>字段不能做的更新规则！！<ol>\n<li>改变已有字段的类型</li>\n<li>复用已删除的字段号</li>\n<li>改变已有字段的编号</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","text":"1. 执行命令编译1protoc --java_out=./src/main/java ./proto3/User.proto 2. 通过maven插件1234...","permalink":"/post/protobuf/protobuf","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"2.2k","symbolsTime":"2 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"protobuf","slug":"protobuf","count":1,"path":"api/categories/protobuf.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"protobuf","slug":"protobuf","count":1,"path":"api/tags/protobuf.json"},{"name":"序列化","slug":"序列化","count":1,"path":"api/tags/序列化.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-4\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#1-%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91\"><span class=\"toc-text\">1. 执行命令编译</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-4\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#2-%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87maven%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6\"><span class=\"toc-text\">2. 通过maven插件</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-4\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#3-proto3\"><span class=\"toc-text\">3. proto3</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/taeyang0126","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"rocksdb","uid":"d86c6b7af2953f2b4230123cab1f7180","slug":"数据库/rocksdb/rocksdb","date":"2025-02-19T23:52:22.000Z","updated":"2025-04-05T00:48:10.790Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/数据库/rocksdb/rocksdb.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"text":"数据写入流程 数据读取流程 db 相关属性 类别 属性名 描述 总体统计 rocksdb.stats 提供详细的数据库统计信息，包括压缩、读写操作、块缓存等数据...","permalink":"/post/数据库/rocksdb/rocksdb","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"2.6k","symbolsTime":"2 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"rocksdb","slug":"rocksdb","count":1,"path":"api/categories/rocksdb.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"数据库","slug":"数据库","count":4,"path":"api/tags/数据库.json"},{"name":"rocksdb","slug":"rocksdb","count":1,"path":"api/tags/rocksdb.json"}],"author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"